§ `s 7(3.1)  (outside Canada; offence; grounds)`
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (b)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under such regulations`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(c)(i) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (c)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(c)(ii) the person who commits the act or omission is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (c)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(d) the act or omission is committed with intent to induce Her Majesty in right of Canada or of a province to commit or cause to be committed any act or omission`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (d)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(e) a person taken hostage by the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (e)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(f) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission thereof, present in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 279.1; ground (f)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no ground
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 279 is not section 279.1
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.2, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- nor is 279.2
#ASSERT `s 7(3.1) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") (LIST `s 7(3.1)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- committed in Canada
#ASSERT `s 7(3.2) to (3.6) as the text shows them` EQUALS "[Repealed, 2013, c. 13, s. 3]"   -- repealed

§ `s 7(3.7)  (outside Canada; offence; relation; grounds)`
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 269.1; ground (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 269.1; ground (b)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 269.1; ground (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(c) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 269.1; ground (c)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(d) the complainant is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 269.1; ground (d)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(e) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission thereof, present in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 269.1; ground (e)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be a conspiracy to commit the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- conspiracy
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be an attempt to commit the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- attempt
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be being an accessory after the fact to the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- accessory
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be counselling in relation to the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- counselling
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission has none of those relations to the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- no relation
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no ground
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 269 is not section 269.1
#ASSERT `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 269.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- committed in Canada

§ `s 7(3.71)  (outside Canada; United Nations personnel by s 2; associated personnel by s 2; property of section 431.1; offence; relation; grounds)`
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under an Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (b)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(c)(i) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (c)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(c)(ii) the person who commits the act or omission is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (c)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(d) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission of the act or omission, present in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (d)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(e) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (e)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(f) the act or omission is committed with intent to compel the Government of Canada or of a province to do or refrain from doing any act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- United Nations personnel; ground (f)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 235, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under an Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- associated personnel
#ASSERT `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.71)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under an Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- property referred to in section 431.1
