§ `s 7(3.72)  (outside Canada; offence; relation; grounds)`
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (b)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(b)(iii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft operated for or on behalf of the Government of Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (b)(iii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(c)(i) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (c)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(c)(ii) the person who commits the act or omission is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (c)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(d) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission of the act or omission, present in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (d)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(e) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (e)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(f) the act or omission is committed with intent to compel the Government of Canada or of a province to do or refrain from doing any act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (f)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(g) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian government or public facility located outside Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 431.2; ground (g)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be a conspiracy to commit the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- conspiracy
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be an attempt to commit the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- attempt
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be being an accessory after the fact to the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- accessory
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be counselling in relation to the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- counselling
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission has none of those relations to the offence` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- no relation
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no ground
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.1, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 431.1 is not 431.2
#ASSERT `s 7(3.72) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 431.2, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.72)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under any Act of Parliament`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- committed in Canada

§ `s 7(3.73)  (outside Canada; offence; relation; grounds)`
