#ASSERT `s 7(3.73) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 83.02, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.73)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as the owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 83.02; ground (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.73) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 83.02, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.73)(c)(i) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 83.02; ground (c)(i)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.73) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 83.02, "") `s 7 the act or omission would be the offence itself` (LIST `s 7(3.73)(c)(ii) the person who commits the act or omission is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- section 83.02; ground (c)(ii)
