§ `s 7(3.74)  (outside Canada; terrorism offence by s 2; section 83.02 or paragraph (a) of terrorist activity; grounds)`
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(a) the person is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(b) the person is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground (b)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(c) the person is a permanent resident within the meaning of subsection 2(1) of the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act and is, after the commission of the act or omission, present in Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground (c)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no ground: "is deemed to have committed that act or omission in Canada if the person"
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE NOTHING FALSE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(a) the person is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 2 did not answer whether it is a terrorism offence
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(a) the person is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a terrorism offence
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(a) the person is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- "other than an offence under section 83.02 or ... paragraph (a) of the definition terrorist activity"
#ASSERT `s 7(3.74) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` FALSE (JUST TRUE) FALSE (LIST `s 7(3.74)(a) the person is a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- committed in Canada

§ `s 7(3.75)  (outside Canada; class of offence; terrorist activity of paragraph (b) by s 83.01(1); grounds)`
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an indictable offence` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(a) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground (a)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an indictable offence` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(b) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian government or public facility located outside Canada`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground (b)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an indictable offence` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(c) the act or omission is committed with intent to compel the Government of Canada or of a province to do or refrain from doing any act`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground (c)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an indictable offence` (JUST TRUE) EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no ground
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(a) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- an offence also punishable by indictment
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an offence punishable on summary conviction` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(a) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not an indictable offence
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an indictable offence` NOTHING (LIST `s 7(3.75)(a) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- section 83.01(1) did not answer
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` TRUE `an indictable offence` (JUST FALSE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(a) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a terrorist activity of paragraph (b)
#ASSERT `s 7(3.75) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` FALSE `an indictable offence` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 7(3.75)(a) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- committed in Canada

